/**
 * TimeRegistration — security model, part 4: hardening
 *
 * A fee earner needs client names to recognise their own matters, but has no
 * reason to read the billing contact — that address is only used on the
 * per-customer report, which is partner-level. Lint rule SEC008.
 *
 * The other item SEC008's sibling rule raises, strict XPath mode (SEC005), is
 * not settable from MDL: mxcli's own hint suggests
 * "ALTER PROJECT SECURITY STRICT MODE ON", which its parser rejects. It has to
 * be switched on in Studio Pro.
 */
revoke "TimeReg"."FeeEarner" on "TimeReg"."Client" (read (ReportEmail));
/
